    "title": "Thad Matta retirement: Ohio State coach Jake Diebler reaction to news",
    "text": "BUTLERWhy Thad Matta's retirement from coaching at Butler is 'not great for college basketball' Adam JardyColumbus DispatchMarch 16, 2026, 4:45 p.m. ETOhio State men’s basketball coach Jake Diebler was about three minutes into a discussion about his team’s first-round NCAA Tournament opponent when the news broke.Thad Matta, the all-time winningest coach in Buckeyes history, was retiring from the profession after spending the last four years leading Butler. During his 21-year career as a head coach, Matta made the most noise at Ohio State, where he went 337-123 in 13 seasons from 2004-2017.",
